From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:15:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 260/262] 4927: GET /threads/:id/chain-position, the middle of
 a chain sees both sides
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Giorgi (13 Oct): when someone comes after the owner in a chain, the design
shows previous person → you → next person. For a conversation opened by a
question asked of its owner, the route names who asked (as the owner saved
them, with member_id for the card) and lists the questions the owner
passed on, each in the routes board's own row shape and states. For an
introduction the owner was asked to make: the requester and the person to
introduce. Empty for anything else, or a conversation not theirs.

